Table: ZEQUIPMENT
Description: Equipment master data

Key fields:
- CLIENT
- EQUI_ID

Main fields:
- DESCRIPTION (CHAR 60)
- CATEGORY (ZCATEG_DE)
- SERIAL_NUMB (NUMC 10)
- LOCATION (CHAR 60)
- IS_ACTIVE (BOOLEAN)

Administrative fields:
- CREATED_BY
- CREATED_AT
- LOCAL_LAST_CHANGED_BY
- LOCAL_LAST_CHANGED_AT

Used as:
- Persistent table for Equipment RAP BO
